interface.longDescription:
Meerlume lets a business owner set up and run a customer chat bot from ChatGPT: a bot that answers customers' questions, takes bookings and captures enquiries and orders on WhatsApp, Instagram, Messenger, Telegram and a website chat.

With Meerlume in ChatGPT you can:
- build a bot by describing your business, or change what a bot says and asks;
- set up services, staff, opening hours, closed days and special hours;
- publish or unpublish a bot, and add website chat;
- look up your bots, conversations, contacts and bookings;
- get a link to connect WhatsApp, Telegram, Messenger, Instagram, Stripe, Slack or Notion, which you finish in Meerlume.

Changes to what a bot says stay unpublished until you publish them. Meerlume in ChatGPT cannot delete bots or message your customers. You sign in with your Meerlume account and choose Allow; there is no API key.
